<title>SWITZERLAND: SBC's Ospel sees more sector job losses.</title>
<headline>SBC's Ospel sees more sector job losses.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Structural changes still under way in the Swiss banking sector should result in further job losses of between five to 10 percent, Swiss Bank Corp Chief Executive Marcel Ospel said.</p>
<p>&quot;The number of employed in the banking sector has thus far fallen by about 15 percent. A further reduction of from five to 10 percent should follow in the coming years,&quot; Ospel said in an interview published in the Wednesday edition of the Swiss newspaper Handelszeitung. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
